/* ============================================================
   Life situations: the services a moment in life usually needs,
   in the order the citizen will need them (my.gov.uz «Жизненные
   ситуации», redrawn in eKhizmat's own anatomy — design-guide §3
   «Citizen life situations»).

   One source for the home cards, the «see all» list, the pages and
   the search. A step names a real registry service by its section
   and the start of its official Russian name (`re`), so the page links
   to the same overview the catalogue opens; `href` links a built flow
   (the baby journey, the emergency mode) instead. A step without
   services is something the citizen does in person — the page says
   what to bring rather than pretending it is online.
   ============================================================ */

